# Skills kept in ~/.claude/skills/. One name per line; # starts a comment.
#
# install.sh moves anything here that is not listed to ~/.claude/skills-archive/.
# Moved, never deleted: several skills have no upstream recorded anywhere on
# disk, so a delete would be irreversible.
#
# This file only governs ~/.claude/skills/. Plugin skills cannot be removed
# individually -- `claude plugin disable` takes a plugin, not a skill, and
# edits to the plugin cache are wiped on update. caveman and superpowers are
# all-or-nothing, and both are kept.

karpathy-guidelines
